      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Woodstock%2C_New_Brunswick",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1923 a freshet destroyed the first hydro‑electric station at Hayden Dam and washed out the Meduxnekeag bridge.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
