      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Woodstock’s name may honor Viscount Woodstock, a junior title of the Duke of Portland, who was Prime Minister when Loyalists arrived.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
